{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Go from me</b> — מעלי in gematria is בפסח (on Passover), teaching that on Passover they went out." "<b>Add not</b> — two times in the Masorah: אל תוסף דבר אלי עוד בדבר הזה (add not a word to me further in this matter), אל תהי קללת הדיוט קלה בעיניך (let not the curse of an ordinary person be light in your eyes). For because he said to him 'add not to see my face, for on the day you see my face you shall die,' HaShem said to him at the time of his death: 'add not a word to me further in this matter.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:28.790969277Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}